#: views/form.php:124
msgid ""
"The Asterisk language code you want to change to. For example \"fr\" for "
"French, \"de\" for German"
msgstr "您想要切換到的 Asterisk 語言代碼。例如「fr」代表法語，「de」代表德語"

#: views/form.php:81
msgid ""
"The descriptive name of this language instance. For example \"French Main "
"IVR\""
msgstr "此語言實例的描述名稱。例如「French Main IVR」"

#: functions.inc.php:179
msgid ""
"This will cause all messages and voice prompts to use the selected language "
"if installed."
msgstr "這將使所有訊息與語音提示使用所選語言（若已安裝）。"

#: functions.inc.php:177
msgid ""
"This will cause all messages and voice prompts to use the selected language "
"if installed.  Languages can be added or removed in the Sound Languages "
"module"
msgstr "這將使所有訊息與語音提示使用所選語言（若已安裝）。語言可以在 Sound Languages 模組中新增或移除"

